From: Ray Liu <ray.xy.liu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 14 May 2026 09:55:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: AN7563 debug - log dev_xmit (TEMP)

Diagnostic data so far on AN7563:

  * airoha_eth probe + airoha_dev_open succeed
  * mt7530 enumerate lan1..lan4, lan3 link up 1Gbps/Full
  * FE GDM1 hw RX counter ticks (eth0/statistics/rx_packets rising)
  * FE GDM1 hw TX counter stays 0 even after EVB-side ping
  * airoha_eth.0..7 IRQ count in /proc/interrupts: 0 (QDMA never IRQs)
  * NPU mbox / wdt IRQ count: 0 (NPU firmware probably not running)

To isolate where TX dies (DSA / br-lan vs driver xmit vs QDMA HW),
trace airoha_dev_xmit() both on entry and right before NETDEV_TX_OK.
Debug only.

Signed-off-by: Ray Liu <ray.xy.liu@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -2135,6 +2135,10 @@
 	u16 index;
 	u8 fport;
 
+	dev_info_ratelimited(qdma->eth->dev,
+		"AN7563 TX: xmit dev=%s gdm_id=%u len=%u uses_dsa=%d\n",
+		dev->name, port->id, skb->len, netdev_uses_dsa(dev));
+
 	qid = airoha_qdma_get_txq(qdma, skb_get_queue_mapping(skb));
 	tag = airoha_get_dsa_tag(skb, dev);
 
@@ -2243,6 +2247,10 @@
 
 	spin_unlock_bh(&q->lock);
 
+	dev_info_ratelimited(qdma->eth->dev,
+		"AN7563 TX: queued qid=%d head=%u fport=%u msg0=0x%x msg1=0x%x\n",
+		qid, index, fport, msg0, msg1);
+
 	return NETDEV_TX_OK;
 
 error_unmap:
